Package: roslyn-workbench-mcp
Version: @VERSION@
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Lantean Code <lanteancode@gmail.com>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: dotnet-runtime-10.0 (>= 10.0.0)
Homepage: https://lantean-code.github.io/roslyn-workbench-mcp/
Description: Roslyn-powered MCP server for C# analysis and refactoring
 Local stdio MCP server providing compiler-aware code inspection and
 transactional refactoring. Includes the bundled first-party plugins.
 A compatible .NET SDK and MSBuild are needed for workspace operations;
 the server reports their availability. Configure your MCP client separately.
